WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.380
A ring timer: 10 minutes.

2
00:00:02.430 --> 00:00:04.140
Two extract pages.

3
00:00:04.190 --> 00:00:06.450
One small card of bullet points.

4
00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:09.220
Fill the ring one way: lopsided.

5
00:00:09.270 --> 00:00:12.480
Fill it again: one long
block at the start.

6
00:00:12.530 --> 00:00:15.190
A third time, in even slices.

7
00:00:15.240 --> 00:00:18.130
Then 5 minutes of your
teacher's questions.

8
00:00:18.180 --> 00:00:21.410
Ten minutes, two extracts, one teacher.

9
00:00:21.460 --> 00:00:23.320
So how do you spend them?

10
00:00:23.370 --> 00:00:27.000
In this mission, you'll choose
extracts of up to 40 lines,

11
00:00:27.050 --> 00:00:29.690
ones that open out to the work as a whole.

12
00:00:29.740 --> 00:00:31.970
You'll plan a shape for the ten minutes.

13
00:00:32.020 --> 00:00:35.180
And you'll ask what your
outline, up to 10 bullet points,

14
00:00:35.230 --> 00:00:36.660
is actually for.

15
00:00:36.710 --> 00:00:40.210
Your mission: work out how
to spend the ten minutes.
